pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 20]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 1 · THE STORY}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 66, 832, 40]
    content: {style: "$title", wrap: false, text: "09:30 UTC: the outgoing shift hands you a problem"}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 116, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1 832,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: narrative
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 138, 832, 78]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 15
      text: |
        <p>Patrol <strong>LANTERN</strong> is already in the field. The outgoing shift suspects its movement
        details were disclosed — an account password was reset at 09:20, and a viewer tool was run minutes
        later. Endpoint, network, identity, document-service and SIEM exports are already collected.</p>
  - elementId: keyline
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 226, 832, 22]
    content: {style: "$body", fontSize: 15, bold: true, wrap: false, text: "No confirmed harm. Do not assume it is over."}
  - elementId: col1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 258, 250, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 15, bold: true, color: "$slate", wrap: false, text: WHAT WE KNOW}
  - elementId: col1-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 284, 250, 2]
    viewBox: [250, 2]
    points: "0,1 250,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: col1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 296, 250, 150]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>· A password reset happened at 09:20 UTC</p>
        <p>· A viewer tool was downloaded and accessed a browser session store</p>
        <p>· All evidence exports are already collected and waiting for you</p>
  - elementId: col2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [355, 258, 250, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 15, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: WHAT WE DON'T KNOW}
  - elementId: col2-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [355, 284, 250, 2]
    viewBox: [250, 2]
    points: "0,1 250,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: col2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [355, 296, 250, 150]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>· Which movements were exposed, and to whom</p>
        <p>· How access was gained</p>
        <p>· Which systems are still affected</p>
        <p>· Whether the incident has ended</p>
  - elementId: col3-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [646, 258, 250, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 15, bold: true, color: "$slate", wrap: false, text: WHAT YOU DO ABOUT IT}
  - elementId: col3-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [646, 284, 250, 2]
    viewBox: [250, 2]
    points: "0,1 250,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: col3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [646, 296, 250, 150]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>· Investigate the evidence in teams</p>
        <p>· Label every claim: confirmed, assessed, or unknown</p>
        <p>· Build a defensible shared assessment before the day ends</p>
  - elementId: fiction
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 466, 832, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: All names, hosts, addresses and artifacts are fictional exercise material. Nothing here is a real system or person.
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "3"}
